{"id":8298,"date":"2021-12-31T16:38:37","date_gmt":"2021-12-31T21:38:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=8298"},"modified":"2021-12-31T16:38:37","modified_gmt":"2021-12-31T21:38:37","slug":"christmas-in-mexico","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/12\/31\/christmas-in-mexico\/","title":{"rendered":"Christmas in Mexico"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>We left our winter home at Rovers Roost on Saturday December 18th and met up with our friend Heidy at her home in Green Valley AZ for the night.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Sunday morning bright and early (still dark) we left her place about 6:30 and headed down I-10 and I-19 to the border crossing at Nogales.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Once we crossed the border onto MX15 we still had an inspection station, an immagration station, and 3 tolls booths to get through.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We stayed on MX15 (a four lane divided highway) down to Hermosillo where we then headed west about 60 more miles on MX100 to Bahia de Kino (Kino Bay) where we then pulled in to Islandia Marina and RV Park.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Our host Martita greeted us with a smile and pointed out two possible sites for us.  We chose the one nestled under a big tree overlooking the Sea of Cortez.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/20211220080243.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/20211220080243.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8305\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/20211220080243.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/20211220080243-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/20211220080243-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>We have a large site with plenty of shade over the coach, 1000&#8242; of sandy beach, sun and water out our front window<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The nights are cool, in the 40&#8217;s and 50&#8217;s and the days are breezy and in the low 80&#8217;s with lots of sunshine.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Our first full day found us keeping busy going about 20 minutes east to San Miguel Aleman to exchange our dollars for pesos, to pick up a few groceries, and to a local Telcel agent to get a 30 day MX sim card for my phone.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Just to give you an idea of how money works here, $100 American is about 2000 MX pesos.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Our groceries at a super market cost us $8.90, my 30 day unlimited talk and text (4.5gb data) sim card cost me $11.50, and our 30 amp full hookup site overlooking the beach at the Sea of Cortez costs $15\/night.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>While last night we cooked brats on the grill at our home by the beach, tonight we ate at Pulpo Loco (Crazy Octopus) in town.  We got 3 combo plates of fried fish, bacon wrapped cheese stuffed shrimp, salad, fries, and fried shrimp.  All 3 meals along with two bottles of Coke and a huge bottled water was 520 pesos (about $26)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211221_141704409.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211221_141704409.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8306\" class=\"wp-image-8306\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211221_141704409.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211221_141704409-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211221_141704409-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211221_144401746.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211221_144401746.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8307\" class=\"wp-image-8307\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211221_144401746.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211221_144401746-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211221_144401746-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211221_141717333.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211221_141717333.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8308\" class=\"wp-image-8308\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211221_141717333.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211221_141717333-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211221_141717333-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-caption\">Our dinner at Pulpo Loco in Kino Bay<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Our first day here at Islandia RV Park we had the pleasure of meeting Julio, one of the regulars whose been spending winters here since 2007.  A retired NYC firefighter, he&#8217;s quite a character.  Although he doesn&#8217;t own or even manage the park, he loves to play host and invited us to join the gang at his place anytime we see anyone there.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Julio and others invited us down for Ray&#8217;s 89th birthday party complete with pizza and birthday cake<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211222_162445778_MP.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211222_162445778_MP.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8309\" class=\"wp-image-8309\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211222_162445778_MP.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211222_162445778_MP-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211222_162445778_MP-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Julio, one of the regulars<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211222_162325104.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211222_162325104.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8310\" class=\"wp-image-8310\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211222_162325104.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211222_162325104-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211222_162325104-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211222_162302153.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211222_162302153.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8311\" class=\"wp-image-8311\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211222_162302153.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211222_162302153-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211222_162302153-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-caption\">Ray&#8217;s 89th Birthday Party<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Thursday morning came too soon and it was time to say goodbye to our host Martita and head further south about 120 miles to Totonaka RV Park at San Carlos, also on the east side of the Sea of Cortez.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_105536779_HDR.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_105536779_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8312\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_105536779_HDR.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_105536779_HDR-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_105536779_HDR-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>Saying goodbye to our host Martita at Islandia RV Park (Bahia de Kino, Sonora, MX)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>San Carlos is a much larger town that Kino Bay and is more a tourist area loaded with restaurants and curio shops.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The park is very nice with over 140 FHU RV sites and about 25 motel rooms.  Heidy is in one of their rooms and we are in the coach.  They have a pool, hot tub, pickleball courts and they run a clean tight ship here, they&#8217;re always cleaning, raking, and checking the property.  At this park our FHU site cost $26\/nite (tourist area pricing).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153655161.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153655161.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8316\" class=\"wp-image-8316\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153655161.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153655161-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153655161-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211226_072910292.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211226_072910292.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8314\" class=\"wp-image-8314\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211226_072910292.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211226_072910292-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211226_072910292-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211224_103552509.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211224_103552509.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8315\" class=\"wp-image-8315\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211224_103552509.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211224_103552509-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211224_103552509-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153532430.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153532430.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8317\" class=\"wp-image-8317\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153532430.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153532430-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153532430-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153511893.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153511893.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8318\" class=\"wp-image-8318\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153511893.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153511893-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153511893-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153415973.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153415973.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8319\" class=\"wp-image-8319\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153415973.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153415973-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153415973-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_152627608.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_152627608.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8320\" class=\"wp-image-8320\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_152627608.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_152627608-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_152627608-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153351865.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153351865.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8321\" class=\"wp-image-8321\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153351865.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153351865-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211223_153351865-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-caption\">140+ sites at Totonaka RV Park @ San Carlos, Sonora, MX<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/Map-BahiaKinoSanCarlos.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/Map-BahiaKinoSanCarlos.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8322\" width=\"718\" height=\"775\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/Map-BahiaKinoSanCarlos.jpg 500w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/Map-BahiaKinoSanCarlos-278x300.jpg 278w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 718px) 100vw, 718px\" \/><\/a><figcaption>Map of our route ending at San Carlos, Guaymas Sonora, MX<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The day after Christmas, there is the annual lighted boat parade right off the beach and we walked down to watch as about twenty five or thirty large vessels dressed in hundreds of Christmas lights paraded by.  It was a fun (and free) evening.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>I&#8217;m sorry the pictures are blurry, it was dark and the camera had a hard time focusing.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/202112261851278497414111908052487.jpg\" data-id=\"8329\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/202112261851278497414111908052487.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com?p=8329\" class=\"wp-image-8329\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/202112261851278497414111908052487.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/202112261851278497414111908052487-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/202112261851278497414111908052487-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/20211226194845784696414535568853.jpg\" data-id=\"8326\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/20211226194845784696414535568853.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com?p=8326\" class=\"wp-image-8326\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/20211226194845784696414535568853.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/20211226194845784696414535568853-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/20211226194845784696414535568853-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/202112261948515114059866044416106.jpg\" data-id=\"8327\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/202112261948515114059866044416106.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com?p=8327\" class=\"wp-image-8327\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/202112261948515114059866044416106.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/202112261948515114059866044416106-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/202112261948515114059866044416106-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/img_20211226_1855105842932303485483793485.jpg\" data-id=\"8328\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/img_20211226_1855105842932303485483793485.jpg\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com?p=8328\" class=\"wp-image-8328\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/img_20211226_1855105842932303485483793485.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/img_20211226_1855105842932303485483793485-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/img_20211226_1855105842932303485483793485-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/img_20211226_1857073827219734529332874773.jpg\" data-id=\"8325\" class=\"wp-image-8325\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/img_20211226_1857073827219734529332874773.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/img_20211226_1857073827219734529332874773-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/img_20211226_1857073827219734529332874773-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/img_20211226_1851183556536677117163553507.jpg\" data-id=\"8324\" class=\"wp-image-8324\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/img_20211226_1851183556536677117163553507.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/img_20211226_1851183556536677117163553507-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/img_20211226_1851183556536677117163553507-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Now the weather turned cool.  Gray skies after Christmas and temps in the 50&#8217;s and 60&#8217;s so no beach time for now.  But there ARE still PLENTY of places to eat that many of our neighbors here at Totonaka have told us that we need to check out.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The girls went shopping today, they were gone about 4 hours and came back all excited about what they stumbled across &#8230; a place where Heidy and\/or Kathy and I could rent an RV spot either monthly or year-round and at a very attractive price!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We talked at some length about the possibilities and decided that all three of us would make a 2nd visit tomorrow.  In the meantime &#8230; what else?  It&#8217;s dinner time!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-5 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_171234708.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_171234708.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8333\" class=\"wp-image-8333\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_171234708.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_171234708-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_171234708-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_172140616.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_172140616.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8334\" class=\"wp-image-8334\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_172140616.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_172140616-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_172140616-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_175429409.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_175429409.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8335\" class=\"wp-image-8335\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_175429409.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_175429409-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_175429409-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_181330713.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_181330713.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8336\" class=\"wp-image-8336\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_181330713.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_181330713-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211228_181330713-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Kathy and Heidy (after a great meal!)<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>We went back to Daniel&#8217;s place the day after Christmas to &#8220;scope it out&#8221; a little more.  He has four covered RV spots that are 60+ feet deep and about 30&#8242; wide with an add&#8217;l 12&#8217;x60&#8242; concrete patio.  All sites are Full Hook-Up (water, electric, and sewer).  The property is fenced and gated and Daniel and his wife live full-time on the property.  He made Heidy a really sweet deal ($250\/month) to park her rig there year round and stay in it full-time or for a few months at a time.  Two of the four sites are occupied by folks who live there year-round.  NOTE: Take a look at the supports for the roof.  These are NOT trees but actually they are BRANCHES from giant eucalyptus trees.  Eucalyptus is a very dense and heavy wood and makes for an excellent building material in this dry climate.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-6 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_135112985.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_135112985.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8340\" class=\"wp-image-8340\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_135112985.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_135112985-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_135112985-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_135046757.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_135046757.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8341\" class=\"wp-image-8341\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_135046757.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_135046757-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_135046757-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_133926045.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_133926045.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8342\" class=\"wp-image-8342\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_133926045.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_133926045-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_133926045-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_133859695.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_133859695.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8343\" class=\"wp-image-8343\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_133859695.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_133859695-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_133859695-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_133405872.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_133405872.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8344\" class=\"wp-image-8344\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_133405872.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_133405872-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_133405872-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-caption\">Daniel&#8217;s RV sites for rent<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>While visiting Daniel he drew a map for us to check out the &#8220;lookout&#8221; and one of the high-end new home developments on the bay.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-7 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144229199.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144229199.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8346\" class=\"wp-image-8346\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144229199.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144229199-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144229199-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144218756.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144218756.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8347\" class=\"wp-image-8347\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144218756.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144218756-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144218756-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144209460.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144209460.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8348\" class=\"wp-image-8348\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144209460.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144209460-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144209460-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_143924255.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_143924255.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8349\" class=\"wp-image-8349\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_143924255.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_143924255-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_143924255-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144254695.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144254695.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8350\" class=\"wp-image-8350\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144254695.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144254695-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_144254695-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_145222602.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_145222602.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8351\" class=\"wp-image-8351\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_145222602.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_145222602-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_145222602-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-caption\">A small peek at one of the many new home developments just on the edge of San Carlos<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>To round out the afternoon (and our last day in Mexico) we decided to &#8230;. what else?  Try out another restaurant of course!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-8 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_160904093.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"405\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_160904093.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8352\" class=\"wp-image-8352\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_160904093.jpg 405w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_160904093-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 405px) 100vw, 405px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_154114333.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_154114333.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8353\" class=\"wp-image-8353\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_154114333.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_154114333-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_154114333-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_153008629.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_153008629.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8354\" class=\"wp-image-8354\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_153008629.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_153008629-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_153008629-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_152848130.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"405\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_152848130.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8355\" class=\"wp-image-8355\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_152848130.jpg 405w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_152848130-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 405px) 100vw, 405px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_152224691.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_152224691.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8356\" class=\"wp-image-8356\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_152224691.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_152224691-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/12\/IMG_20211229_152224691-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The restaurant celebrates the &#8220;Day of the Dead&#8221; which is a Mexican holiday on November 1st and 2nd.  It celebrates the lives of loved ones who have died over the last year.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>From Google: &#8220;Ancient Mesoamericans believed that death was part of the journey of life. Rather than death ending life, they believed that new life came from death. This cycle is often associated with the cyclical nature of agriculture, whereby crops grow from the ground where the last crop lies buried.&#8221;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>All in all, we had a great time visiting Mexico and making new friends.  In a nutshell we have to say that; <\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>The Mexican people are gracious, friendly, accommodating, and thankful that we were there spending our money in their communities.<\/li><li>The food cost is about one-half of what a meal (restaurant or grocery store) would cost in the states.<\/li><li>Fuel is about the same cost or even a little more than here in the states,<\/li><li>and the roads are generally terrible.  Certainly not everywhere, but there are plenty of areas where you have to wonder if the RV is just going to shake apart right there on the spot.<\/li><li>And the poverty is nearly everywhere, at least it&#8217;s not at all hard to find.  We say plenty of people living in tin and cardboard shacks with no electricity and no running water.  It&#8217;s sad to see such distress.<\/li><\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p>We drove our last day straight through from San Carlos to Casa Grande AZ (395 miles) and we have to say it&#8217;s &#8220;good to be back&#8221;.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Until next time, we wish you and yours a Happy New Year.  We hope it&#8217;s a safe and healthy one for all of us.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><strong>Herb and Kathy<\/strong><\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We left our winter home at Rovers Roost on Saturday December 18th and met up with our friend Heidy at her home in Green Valley AZ for the night. Sunday morning bright and early (still dark) we left her place about 6:30 and headed down I-10 and I-19 to the border crossing at Nogales. Once &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2021\/12\/31\/christmas-in-mexico\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Christmas in Mexico<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[554708023,13403,677,554707836,554708025,19546,554708026,554707329],"tags":[554708132,13789,554708135,554708133,554708131,554707415,783,554707494,554708134,554707367,554708136,3559,554708130,554708138,554708137],"class_list":["post-8298","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-campground-review","category-camping","category-friends","category-mexico","category-rving","category-sightseeing","category-touring","category-traveling","tag-bahia-de-kino","tag-dinner","tag-eat","tag-heidy","tag-kino-bay","tag-mexican","tag-mexico","tag-motorhome","tag-pesos","tag-restaurant","tag-roads","tag-rv","tag-san-carlos","tag-toll-roads","tag-tolls"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8298","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=8298"}],"version-history":[{"count":16,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8298\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":8361,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8298\/revisions\/8361"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=8298"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=8298"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=8298"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}